From: TG5050 downstream reconstruction
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: select the shipping TG5050 DE channel split

The pinned shipping kernel DTB selects chn_cfg_mode = <2>. Use that
split now that the missing DE350 mode-2 records have been recovered.
Keep this board-policy change separate from the driver table patch.

--- a/configs/pro3_linux_aiot/linux-5.15/board.dts
+++ b/configs/pro3_linux_aiot/linux-5.15/board.dts
@@ -242,7 +242,7 @@
 };
 
 &de {
-	chn_cfg_mode = <0>;
+	chn_cfg_mode = <2>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
